OL,3,GNEWSACouncil-run homeless day centre
OL,4,A'more than a drop-in'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new day centre for homeless people
OL,7,Fand rough sleepers in a city is "much
OL,8,Fmore than a drop-in centre", a
OL,9,Fcouncillor has said.
OL,11,FPreston City Council-run hub, at Oakham
OL,12,FCourt, is scheduled to begin phased
OL,13,Fservices from Monday and will
OL,14,Feventually offer essential casework,
OL,15,Fassessments, meals, laundry and shower
OL,16,Fservices seven days a week.
OL,18,FCouncillor Peter Kelly said the centre
OL,19,Fhad "accommodation at its heart" and he
OL,20,Fwanted people to know "help is
OL,21,Favailable".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
