OL,3,GNEWSACouncil-run homeless day centre
OL,4,A'more than a drop-in'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomeless charity the Foxton Centre
OL,7,Fclosed its doors last week after 50
OL,8,Fyears in the city, although it will
OL,9,Fstill be providing services out on the
OL,10,Fstreet.
